"3","role":0,"stats":[46,11,68,71,76,36],"title":-1,"rank":"7","loyalty":"99","reputation":"25250","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007002","armor":"WP1018005","helmet":"WP1026005"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1003","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[46,11,68,71,76,36],"title":-1,"rank":"7","loyalty":"100","reputation":"25250","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007002","armor":"WP1018005","helmet":"WP1026005"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"许靖从兄，汉末陈国相，出身汝南许氏。灵帝末年，许玚得拜陈国相，镇陈国，辅佐陈王刘宠。初平元年关东举义讨董卓，许玚与豫州刺史孔伷合谋举兵响应关东联军，在豫州境内起兵，参与讨董之役。其事牵连宗族，许靖惧怕祸及自身，出逃投奔孔伷避难。许玚任陈国相时间不长，不久去职，由骆俊继任陈国相。","tc":"許靖從兄，漢末陳國相，出身汝南許氏。靈帝末年，許玚得拜陳國相，鎮陳國，輔佐陳王劉寵。初平元年關東舉義討董卓，許玚與豫州刺史孔伷合謀舉兵響應關東聯軍，在豫州境內起兵，參與討董之役。其事牽連宗族，許靖懼怕禍及自身，出逃投奔孔伷避難。許玚任陳國相時間不長，不久去職，由駱俊繼任陳國相。","en":"Elder cousin of Xu Jing and Chancellor of Chen in the late Han, hailing from the prominent Xu family of Runan. In the late reign of Emperor Ling, Xu Yang was appointed Chancellor of Chen, garrisoning the realm of Chen and assisting Liu Chong, Prince of Chen. In the first year of Chuping, when the Guandong coalition rose against Dong Zhuo, Xu Yang conspired with Kong Zhou, Lt. Governor of Yu Province, to raise troops in response, taking up arms within Yu Province to join the campaign against Dong Zhuo. As his actions implicated his clan, Xu Jing feared disaster would fall upon himself and fled to Kong Zhou for refuge. Xu Yang did not serve long as Chancellor of Chen, he soon left office and was succeeded by Luo Jun.","jp":"許靖の従兄。後漢末期の陳国相。汝南許氏の出身。霊帝の末年、許玚は陳国相に任じられ、陳国を治めて陳王の劉寵を補佐した。初平元年に董卓討伐の義兵が関東で挙がると、許玚は豫州刺史の孔伷と謀り、関東連合軍に呼応して豫州領内で挙兵し、董卓討伐戦に加わった。その一件で一族に累が及ぶと、許靖は身に災いが及ぶのを恐れて逃走し、孔伷のもとへ身を寄せて難を避けた。許玚が陳国相を務めた期間は短く、間もなく職を辞し、駱俊が陳国相を後任として引き継いだ。","kr":"허정의 사촌 형이자 후한 말의 진국상으로, 여남 허씨 출신이다. 영제 말년에 허창은 진국상에 제수되어 진국을 다스리고 진왕 유총을 보좌했다. 초평 원년, 관동에서 동탁을 토벌하고자 의병이 일어나자, 허창은 예주자사 공주와 거사를 모의하여 관동 연합군에 호응했고, 예주 경내에서 군사를 일으켜 동탁 토벌전에 참전했다. 이 일로 일족이 연루되자 화가 자신에게 미칠 것을 두려워한 허정은 공주에게로 달아나 피신했다. 허창이 진국상에 재임한 기간은 길지 않았으며, 얼마 지나지 않아 면직되어 낙준이 그 뒤를 이어 진국상이 되었다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1043915","remark":"","surname":"许","surnameTc":"許","surnameEn":"Xu","surnameJp":"許","surnameKr":"허","surnameOther":"","name":"玚","nameTc":"玚","nameEn":"Yang","nameJp":"瑒","nameKr":"창","nameOther":"","word":"文休","wordTc":"文休","wordEn":"Wenxiu","wordJp":"文休","wordKr":"문휴","wordOther":"","icon":"许玚","power":"WJ10324","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"184","city":"CS1025","gender":"0","rule":"46","force":"11","wise":"68","politics":"71","charm":"76","will":"36","ruleTalent":"4","forceTalent":"1","wiseTalent":"7","politicsTalent":"9","charmTalent":"7","willTalent":"2","weaponMaster":"10/10/10/10/10/68/10/10","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"1007805","warSoulPoint":"500","battleSoulPoint":"100","debateSoulPoint":"4600","strategy":"1007315","strategy2":"1001305","professions":"0/1/0/0/0/0/1/3/0/2/0/0/0/3/0/0/3/2/1/3/0/0/2/1","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"4","compatible":"58","loyalty":"99","reputation":"25250","evaluate":"3000","title":"","rank":"7","birth":"147","show":"184","death":"222","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"0","type":"0","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImportant":"0","speaking":"1","weapon":"WP1007002","armor":"WP1018005","helmet":"WP1026005","treasure":"","horse":"","shield":"","character":"0/1;2/1;18/1;31/1;41/1;58/1;21/2;29/1;33/3;8/3;69/0","father":"","mother":"","children":"","family":"","modInfo":"","brother":"","couple":"","otherRelationship":"WJ10324/6","belief":"0","isVIP":"0","startVIPYear":"0","endVIPYear":"0","description":"许靖从